stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active
    Active --> Preview: Preview with literal captured email
    Active --> Refused: Preview a terminal deal
    Preview --> Confirmed: Joe confirms unchanged active deal
    Preview --> Refused: Deal becomes terminal before confirmation
    Preview --> Stale: Evidence or digest changes
    Confirmed --> Confirmed: Replay same key after terminal transition
    [*] --> NonDeal: Preview linked client, lead or vendor
    NonDeal --> Confirmed: Joe confirms linked action
    %% never Terminal refusal writes an action, next-step note or event.
    %% never Changed evidence confirms an earlier digest.
